    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Gods of fire range from benevolent protectors of the hearth to raging forces of nature that blow up mountains.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain:&nbsp;</strong>Gain a spell from a different class at your level or lower as a bonus spell. The spell must deal fire damage, or have fire, flame or burn in the name. You can replace the ability score used for attack and damage with Wisdom.</p>\n<p>Whenever a spell deals holy damage, you can change that damage to fire damage instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells:&nbsp;</strong>Burning Brand, Penance by Fire, Flame Strike</p>"
    },
